        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya muwakayila kulonda kuyijilika, kulonda akankalakelaŋa mudimu wawupristu; wakakwati iyoŋa daŋombi wumu weyala, niyizamba yiyedi yanyikoku yakadi ninaha hiyatamina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nimankendi akadi iluŋi, nimankendi akadi iluŋi akubomba namanji, nitumankendi twawubasatwakadi iluŋi twakukwita manji; wakatuŋi nawuŋa watidiku wakusalulula chachiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakashi mwibaŋu dimu, wakajisendeli mwibaŋu, hamuna ŋombi nayizamba yiyedi yanyikoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni nawanyanindi amayala wakayitwali kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena wakayiweleshi nameji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanoni yuma yakuvwala, wakamuvwiki Aroni chi kovwelu chahewulu, ni kanji yefwodi, niifwodi yayeni, nichibwiku chakuvwala hantulu, wakamukasili mumbunda namuya wakwifwodi wakutuŋa nawukalawenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakamuvwiki nkuku hanamutu, wakashinichiba aba chajila hankuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakanoni nimanji akuwayisha nachu, waka muhuŋunwini hanamutu windi, wakamuwayishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaleti ni anyanindi, wakayivwiki yi kovwelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayikasili Aroni nawanyanindi amayala nyiya yawu mumbunda jawu, wakayikasili nimabonye awu; niwupristu wakekali wawu wachidika chahaya nyaka; wakakunjiki aAroni nawanya nindi kumudimu owu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaleti ŋombi kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena; Aroni nawanya nindi amayala akanaŋiki makasawu hanamutu waŋombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakajahi ŋombi kumesu aYehova kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli mashiaŋombi, wakalambi hanseŋu jakukameŋa namunu weyi, mashi akashalahu wakayi mwaŋili ejima kwishina dakameŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli nimanji ejima ajikaŋa hayuma yamwivumu niitandantulu dakumuchima, ninshiya mujiyedi, nimanji aduhu, wakayochi bwi hakameŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa nimbiji yaŋombi, nichitembi chindi, nituji twindi, wakafumishi muchilombu nakwochela kumpata, hihimulambu wahanshidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli nichizamba wumu; Aroni nawanyanindi amayala akanaŋiki makasawu hanamutu wachizamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamujahi chizamba, wakatambuli mashi indi, wakasampuli hakameŋa kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakahaboli chizamba wejima hayidi hayidi, wakakosi niyuma yindi yamwivumu, ninyendu yindi namakasindi, wakayishi hayidi yindi yi kwawu nihanamutuwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamwochi chizamba wejima hakameŋa; hihimulambu wakumushitila Yehova; hilupwembu, hihimulambu wakuhimulambu la Yehova nakesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli chizamba mukwawu; Aroni nawanyanindi amayala akanaŋiki makasawu hanamutu wachizamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamujahi chizamba, wakanonuhu mashi anti, wakashi nihansa yetu daAroni dachidiilu, nihansaja matu achidiilu awanyanindi, nihanyinu yamadimbanu yakumakasawu achidiilu, nihanyinu yamadimbanu yakunyendu yawu yachidiilu, wakasampuli mashi hakameŋa kwi-ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa mashi adi hakameŋa wakanonuhu, wakanonuku nimanji akuwayisha nachu, wakayisampwilu wuAroni niyuma yindi yakuvwala, ni anyanindi amayala, niyuma yawu yakuvwalahamu nayena; wakeli anamujiliki dehi niyena, niyuma yindiyakuvwala, ni anyanindi, niyuma yakuvwala yawanyanindi hamu nayena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchizamba wakafumishi nimanji, nimukila wamanji, nimanji abutaŋa hayuma yamwivumu, niitandantulu dakumuchima, ninshiya muji yedini manjiekalahu, nichikasa chachidiilu; muloŋa hichizamba chamukoku chakukunjika nachu kumudimu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwibapu damankendi akadi iluŋididi kumesu aYehova wakanonumu dimu, nidinkendi dakubomba namanji dimu, nikadinkendi kawubasa kamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakatenteki yumiyi yejima hamakasa aAroni nihamakasa awanyanindi amayala, wakayinyinkeshi yakeli himulambu wakunyinkesha kumesu aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayifumishi kumakasawu, wakayochi hakamejiŋa, wakayocheli hewulu dahimulambu wakushita, kulonda ivumba dadiwahi kumesu aYehova; hihimulambu wakuhimulambu la Yehova nakesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchizamba chaAroni chakukunjika nachu kumudimu, wakanonuku ibwambu, wakadinyinkeshi dakeli himulambu wakunyinkesha kumesu aYehova; dakeli iseka deyi dakudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakajiliki niibwambu dakuhimulambu wakunyinkesha, nichikasa chakuhimulambu wakuleleka, chanyinkeshaŋawu, chaleleka ŋawu, chakuchizamba chamukoku wakukunjika nachukumudimu, yoyambala yaAroni, nawanyanindi amayala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakekali yaAroni nawanyanindi amayala hichidika chakuyinkawu chahaya nyaka, chakutambula kudi anyana kaIsarela; muloŋa hihimulambu wakuleleka; wakekali himulambu wakuleleka wakudi anyana kaIsarela wakuyimuna yakuketolaŋawu yanyilambu yakuwunda, hihimulambu wawu nawa waYehova wakuleleka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuma yakuvwala yaAroni yajila yamba kekalaŋa yawanyanindi amayala amba kahiŋamu, kulonda kuyiwayishilamu manji, nikuyikunjika nachukumudimu wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu mwana wakamuwana kuwupristu akayivwali mafuku atanu nayedi, hohakeŋilaŋayi mwitenti dakubulakena nakukalakala mwajila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambuli chizamba chamukoku chakukunjika nachu kumudimu, wakateleki mbiji yindi mwajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni nawanyanindi amayala akadyimbiji yachizamba nimankendi adi mwibaŋu, akadiyili kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akadyi yuma yina yadibutiluwu nachu, kulonda kuyikunjika nachu kumudimu nikuyijilika; ilaŋa kuyidya kudi mwenyi chinjila muloŋa yajila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikwakacha hela mbiji yakukunjika nachu kumudimu, hela dinkendi, neyi yinashaluhu yinashi ki kubudidi wakayochi nakesi; chinjila kuyidya, muloŋa yajila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chiwakayili Aroni nawanyanindi amayala, mwejima munakulejeli; wakayikunjikaŋa mafuku atanu nayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku hefuku wakalambulaŋa ŋombi weyala, himulambu wahanshidi kulonda kubuta nachu; chiwakela yakubuta nachu kameŋa wakakatookeshi; wakakawayishi nimanji nakukajilika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafuku atanu nayedi wakeli yakubuta nachu kameŋa, nakukajilika; kambiŋa kakeli kajila nankashi, yuma yejima yakakunka kukameŋa yakeliyajila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya yuma yiwakalambulaŋa hakameŋa, anyana kanyikoku ayedi, anyana amwaka wumu hohu, akulambula hefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanakamukoku wumu wakahimulambu laŋa habudidi; mwana kamukoku mukwawu wakahimulambu laŋa hamelela; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwana kamukoku wumu wakahimulambu i aŋanawuŋa wakusalulula chachiwahi wakweseka muchibalu chamwikumi chachimpaya, namanji akusohola akweseka muchibalu chamu chiwana chanswaha; nivinyu yakweseka muchibalu chamuchiwana chanswaha yahimulambu wakuhuŋununa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kamukoku mukwawu wakahimulambu laŋa hamelela, wakeli neyi chiwelaŋa nabudidi nahimulambu wawuŋana himulambu wawu wakuhuŋununa, kulonda kwipuka ivumba dadiwahi, hihimulambu wakuhimulambu la Yehova nakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakekali kwawu himulambu wakushita wakulambulaŋa mafuku ejima mwamba kavwali kilaŋawu anyanenu, wakulambwila kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena kumesu aYehova; kwenoku nakabulakenaŋa nenu kulonda nakahoshaŋa naneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweno kudiku nakabulakena nawanyana kaIsarela, niitenti dakajilikewa nakulemakwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 29:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakajilika niitenti dakubulakena nikameŋa; nakajilika niAroni nawanyanindi amayala hamu kulonda akankalakelaŋa mudimu wawupristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.29.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.29.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
